From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GCSA-ToolsTeam <316909304+GCSA-ToolsTeam@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] 统一移动设置导航与三端表单布局

---
